{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pcb2pwja","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":190,"width":1080,"height":79},"text":"Zeetrex muestra el flujo. DIARCO nombra dueño, referente y suplente. La sesión termina con un pedido de datos y fecha de devolución.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ob21wr2p","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":67,"top":283,"width":1080,"height":35},"text":"2. Lote de prueba","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#007A87","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/natknm14","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":316,"width":1080,"height":79},"text":"Compras elige tres proveedores reales. Otros circuitos eligen tres documentos o situaciones equivalentes.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2pkjuhkj","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":67,"top":409,"width":1080,"height":35},"text":"3. Usuarios","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#007A87","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xgv2twj6","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":442,"width":1080,"height":79},"text":"DIARCO define personas, roles, autorizadores, sucursales y segregación. IT y el administrador configuran TEST.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cf210bil","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":67,"top":535,"width":1080,"height":35},"text":"4. Práctica individual","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#007A87","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ixoni1g3","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":68,"top":568,"width":1080,"height":79},"text":"Titular y suplente ejecutan un caso normal y una excepción con apoyo Zeetrex. Se registra aptitud y evidencia.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gqpery","slideIndex":3,"text":"Detalle: documentacion/11_capacitacion_usuarios_y_accesos.md y 12_lote_pruebas_y_evidencia_referentes.md"}
