{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e9sb2hkb","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":68,"top":190,"width":1080,"height":107},"text":"DIARCO ejecuta casos con esperado aprobado. Zeetrex acompaña. Cada resultado conserva versión, dato, documento y evidencia.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fu1svmlw","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67,"top":311,"width":1080,"height":35},"text":"6. Desvío y reprueba","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#007A87","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gvat472h","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":68,"top":344,"width":1080,"height":107},"text":"El referente informa el error el mismo día. Zeetrex corrige. DIARCO repite el caso con una ejecución nueva.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1wjaxc32","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67,"top":465,"width":1080,"height":35},"text":"7. Paralelo y aceptación","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#007A87","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ypcbe1kv","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":68,"top":498,"width":1080,"height":107},"text":"Comparamos con SGM durante ciclos reales. El dueño acepta el circuito probado; la habilitación productiva se decide por población.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#18334F","alignment":"left"}}
